<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-93] SparkSQL returning java.lang.NumberFormatException: For input string: &quot;5s&quot;</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-93</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;#When I run this from Zeppelin:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;case class Health (year:  String, state: String, category:String, funding_src1: String, funding_scr2: String, spending: Integer)&lt;br/&gt;
val health = dataset.map(k=&amp;gt;k.split(&quot;,&quot;)).map(&lt;br/&gt;
    k =&amp;gt; Health(k(0),k(1),k(2),k(3), k(4), k(5).toInt)&lt;br/&gt;
    )&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;health.setName(&quot;health_table&quot;)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;%sql&lt;br/&gt;
select state, sum(spending)/1000 SpendinginBillions &lt;br/&gt;
from health_table &lt;br/&gt;
group by state &lt;br/&gt;
order by SpendinginBillions desc&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;#I get the following error:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;java.lang.NumberFormatException: For input string: &quot;5s&quot;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;Spark 1.3.1&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
        <key id="12835487">ZEPPELIN-93</key>
            <summary>SparkSQL returning java.lang.NumberFormatException: For input string: &quot;5s&quot;</summary>
