                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14573341" author="doanduyhai" created="Thu, 4 Jun 2015 18:33:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Humm, I have the feeling that the culprit is here:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;k(5).toInt
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt; Are you sure that in your data set , the &lt;b&gt;6th column&lt;/b&gt; is ALWAYS a number ?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14579544" author="jongyoul" created="Tue, 9 Jun 2015 20:51:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I think it&apos;s correct because &quot;5s&quot; is not a number. As mentioned above, if k(5) is not a number, NFE occurs. What do you think the problem is?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14590569" author="arzarif" created="Wed, 17 Jun 2015 20:50:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I was getting the same error when trying to run SparkSQL jobs. My environment consisted of HDP 2.2.4 with Spark 1.3.1. I found that, by default, hive-site.xml has a problematic value that causes this issue:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;[root@sandbox conf]# grep -B 1 5s *
hive-site.xml-      &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;hive.metastore.client.connect.retry.delay&amp;lt;/name&amp;gt;
hive-site.xml:      &amp;lt;value&amp;gt;5s&amp;lt;/value&amp;gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Simply changing this value from &apos;5s&apos; to &apos;5&apos; resolved the issue. I&apos;m not sure if this affects other platforms/versions as well, but it turned out to be the culprit in my case.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Best,&lt;br/&gt;
Ara&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14590664" author="saptak" created="Wed, 17 Jun 2015 21:40:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thank you that solved my issue.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14590667" author="saptak" created="Wed, 17 Jun 2015 21:42:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fix via &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Arzarif&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Arzarif&quot;&gt;Arzarif&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I was getting the same error when trying to run SparkSQL jobs. My environment consisted of HDP 2.2.4 with Spark 1.3.1. I found that, by default, hive-site.xml has a problematic value that causes this issue:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;root@sandbox conf&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;# grep -B 1 5s *&lt;br/&gt;
hive-site.xml-      &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;hive.metastore.client.connect.retry.delay&amp;lt;/name&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
hive-site.xml:      &amp;lt;value&amp;gt;5s&amp;lt;/value&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Simply changing this value from &apos;5s&apos; to &apos;5&apos; resolved the issue. I&apos;m not sure if this affects other platforms/versions as well, but it turned out to be the culprit in my case.&lt;br/&gt;
Best,&lt;br/&gt;
Ara&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
